          <a href="#warranty" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Warranty, Buy-Back and the Home-Use Question</a>
          <a href="#home-requirements" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Power, Floor and Space: Putting a Woodway in a Home</a>
          <a href="#used-and-refurbished" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Buying a Used, Refurbished or Certified Pre-Owned Woodway</a>
